In the event that Purchaser cancels this Agreement in part, the Purchase Amount will be adjusted by Change Order to reflect a decrease equal to the difference between the Cancellation Charge and the portion of the Purchase Amount attributable to the cancelled Units, and (i.e., the Cancellation Charge shall be credited against the Purchase Amount).  In the event that Purchaser cancels this Agreement in whole, then upon payment in full of the Cancellation Charge applicable to the canceled Units as provided in the preceding paragraph and the payment in full of the portion of the Purchase Amount due and payable, the Purchaser shall be irrevocably released and forever discharged from any obligations under this Agreement.  [Note:  The inclusion of this language will vary on a case-by-case basis]
