9.3 Quality Plan.  Seller shall maintain a quality plan compliant with ISO 9001, 1994 and with the quality assurance plan set forth in Exhibit J, detailing:
(i) specific authorities and responsibilities;
(ii) procedures, methods and work instructions; and
(iii) inspection and test plans.
In the event of a conflict between Exhibit J, ISO 9001, 1994 and Seller’s quality system, the order of precedence shall be, ISO 9001, 1994, Seller’s quality system and Exhibit J.
